{"3027820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Nexus Rumble: The Ultimate Showdown", "steam_appid": 3027820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >30 Players. 30+ Game Modes. One Winner.</h2><strong>Nexus Rumble</strong> is a fast-paced online multiplayer party battle royale where up to 30 players clash through rounds of chaotic mini-games. Every match is a gauntlet: survive round after round of ever-changing modes and maps until only one champion remains. Easy to pick up, hilarious with friends, and brutal to master.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027820/extras/0abca19bf27fce66d6a2a36799a88dc0.avif?t=1784912252\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ A Different Game Every Round</h2>With <strong>over 30 game modes across 50+ maps</strong>, no two matches ever play the same. Modes fall into three flavors of chaos:<br><br><strong>🏃 Race</strong> — Sprint, dodge, and leap to the finish before the clock (or the map) takes you out.<br><i>Parkour Run, Red Light Green Light, Stepping Stones, Flood Escape, Marathon, Tile Puzzle and more.</i><br><br><strong>💀 Survival</strong> — Outlast everyone as the arena turns against you.<br><i>Prop Hunt, Hide and Seek, Bomb Tag, Sword Fight, Deathmatch, King of the Hill, Monster Survival, Mingle, Skyfall Showdown and many more.</i><br><br><strong>🤝 Team</strong> — Cooperate to crush the other side.<br><i>Football, Volleyball — with more on the way.</i><br><br>New modes and maps are added in updates, so the roster keeps growing.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 Play With Anyone, Anywhere</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Cross-Platform Multiplayer</strong> — PC and mobile players battle in the same lobbies.<br></li><li> <strong>Custom &amp; Public Lobbies</strong> — Host private matches with friends or jump into public showdowns.<br></li><li> <strong>You Make the Rules</strong> — As host, enable or disable any game mode or map to build your perfect playlist.<br></li><li> <strong>Voice &amp; Text Chat</strong> — Trash talk, team up, and celebrate together.<br></li><li> <strong>Spectator Mode</strong> — Eliminated? Watch the chaos unfold and cheer on the survivors.<br></li><li> <strong>Your Camera, Your Choice</strong> — Switch freely between first-person, third-person, and front-facing views. Gun modes play out in immersive first-person.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Make Your Champion Yours</h2>Stand out in the arena with deep character customization: outfits, patterns, hats, glasses, mustaches, plus full color control over hair, eyes, and skin. Unlock cosmetics and show off <strong>victory dances</strong> when you claim the crown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027820/extras/22b4ff03c9e0a66a5f9fbe8c91c54324.poster.avif?t=1784912252\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027820/extras/22b4ff03c9e0a66a5f9fbe8c91c54324.webm?t=1784912252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027820/extras/22b4ff03c9e0a66a5f9fbe8c91c54324.mp4?t=1784912252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Seasons &amp; Progression</h2>Earn XP every match and progress through the <strong>season reward road</strong> to unlock exclusive cosmetics. New seasons bring fresh rewards to chase.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are You Ready to Rumble?</h2>Gather your friends, queue up, and prove you can outrun, outsmart, and outlast 29 rivals. Victory belongs to the last one standing!", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >30 Players. 30+ Game Modes. One Winner.</h2><strong>Nexus Rumble</strong> is a fast-paced online multiplayer party battle royale where up to 30 players clash through rounds of chaotic mini-games. Every match is a gauntlet: survive round after round of ever-changing modes and maps until only one champion remains. Easy to pick up, hilarious with friends, and brutal to master.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027820/extras/0abca19bf27fce66d6a2a36799a88dc0.avif?t=1784912252\" width=616 height=346 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ A Different Game Every Round</h2>With <strong>over 30 game modes across 50+ maps</strong>, no two matches ever play the same. Modes fall into three flavors of chaos:<br><br><strong>🏃 Race</strong> — Sprint, dodge, and leap to the finish before the clock (or the map) takes you out.<br><i>Parkour Run, Red Light Green Light, Stepping Stones, Flood Escape, Marathon, Tile Puzzle and more.</i><br><br><strong>💀 Survival</strong> — Outlast everyone as the arena turns against you.<br><i>Prop Hunt, Hide and Seek, Bomb Tag, Sword Fight, Deathmatch, King of the Hill, Monster Survival, Mingle, Skyfall Showdown and many more.</i><br><br><strong>🤝 Team</strong> — Cooperate to crush the other side.<br><i>Football, Volleyball — with more on the way.</i><br><br>New modes and maps are added in updates, so the roster keeps growing.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 Play With Anyone, Anywhere</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> <strong>Cross-Platform Multiplayer</strong> — PC and mobile players battle in the same lobbies.<br></li><li> <strong>Custom &amp; Public Lobbies</strong> — Host private matches with friends or jump into public showdowns.<br></li><li> <strong>You Make the Rules</strong> — As host, enable or disable any game mode or map to build your perfect playlist.<br></li><li> <strong>Voice &amp; Text Chat</strong> — Trash talk, team up, and celebrate together.<br></li><li> <strong>Spectator Mode</strong> — Eliminated? Watch the chaos unfold and cheer on the survivors.<br></li><li> <strong>Your Camera, Your Choice</strong> — Switch freely between first-person, third-person, and front-facing views. Gun modes play out in immersive first-person.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎨 Make Your Champion Yours</h2>Stand out in the arena with deep character customization: outfits, patterns, hats, glasses, mustaches, plus full color control over hair, eyes, and skin. Unlock cosmetics and show off <strong>victory dances</strong> when you claim the crown.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027820/extras/22b4ff03c9e0a66a5f9fbe8c91c54324.poster.avif?t=1784912252\" width=616 height=278 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027820/extras/22b4ff03c9e0a66a5f9fbe8c91c54324.webm?t=1784912252\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027820/extras/22b4ff03c9e0a66a5f9fbe8c91c54324.mp4?t=1784912252\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏆 Seasons &amp; Progression</h2>Earn XP every match and progress through the <strong>season reward road</strong> to unlock exclusive cosmetics. New seasons bring fresh rewards to chase.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Are You Ready to Rumble?</h2>Gather your friends, queue up, and prove you can outrun, outsmart, and outlast 29 rivals. Victory belongs to the last one standing!", "short_description": "Ready to rumble? Nexus Rumble is a 30-player, fast-paced multiplayer party royale where players race, hide, fight, and outlast rivals across 30+ chaotic mini-games in a battle to be the last one standing. Crossplay on PC &amp; mobile!", "supported_languages": "English, Russian, Turkish", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027820/3c9ab009c49d4c0611aa2fd1cb2a22662cc45e96/header.jpg?t=1784912252", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3027820/712